msgstr "Cena „od“ pre variabilné produkty"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1431
msgid ""
"Display \"from {price}\" instead of a price range for variable products. "
"Cleaner presentation on archives and product pages."
msgstr ""
"Zobraziť „od {price}“ namiesto cenového rozpätia pri variabilných "
"produktoch. Prehľadnejšia prezentácia v archívoch a na stránkach produktov."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1437
msgid "Enable \"from\" price display"
msgstr "Povoliť zobrazenie ceny „od“"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1438
msgid "Price text template"
msgstr "Šablóna textu ceny"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1438
msgid "Token: {price}"
msgstr "Token: {price}"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1445
msgid "Auto Restore Stock"
msgstr "Automatické obnovenie skladu"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1446
msgid ""
"Automatically restore product stock when orders are cancelled, refunded or "
"failed. Keeps inventory accurate without manual intervention."
msgstr ""
"Automaticky obnoviť sklad produktov pri zrušení, vrátení peňazí alebo "
"zlyhaní objednávok. Udržiava presný stav zásob bez ručného zásahu."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1455
msgid "AJAX Add to Cart"
msgstr "Pridanie do košíka cez AJAX"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1456
msgid ""
"Add products to cart without page reload, including variable products on "
"single product pages. Shows a toast notification on success."
msgstr ""
"Pridávajte produkty do košíka bez obnovenia stránky, vrátane variabilných "
"produktov na stránkach jednotlivých produktov. Po úspechu zobrazí toast "
"notifikáciu."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1467
msgid "GA4 DataLayer / GTM"
msgstr "GA4 DataLayer / GTM"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1468
msgid ""
"Google Analytics 4 ecommerce tracking via dataLayer. Tracks view_item, "
"add_to_cart, begin_checkout, purchase events. Supports GTM container and "
"gtag.js."
msgstr ""
"Sledovanie e-commerce Google Analytics 4 cez dataLayer. Zaznamenáva udalosti "
"view_item, add_to_cart, begin_checkout, purchase. Podporuje kontajner GTM a "
"gtag.js."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1474
msgid "GTM Container ID"
msgstr "ID kontajnera GTM"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1475
msgid "GA4 Measurement ID"
msgstr "ID merania GA4"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1476
msgid "Use SKU as product ID"
msgstr "Použiť SKU ako ID produktu"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1476
msgid "Send SKU instead of WooCommerce product ID in ecommerce events"
msgstr ""
"Odosielať SKU namiesto ID produktu WooCommerce v e-commerce udalostiach"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1481 src/Service/StockExportService.php:39
#: src/Service/StockExportService.php:40 src/Service/StockExportService.php:64
msgid "Stock Export"
msgstr "Export skladu"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1482
msgid ""
"Export WooCommerce product stock data as CSV. Configurable fields, stock "
"threshold filters, variation support. Available under Products > Stock "
"Export."
msgstr ""
"Exportujte údaje o sklade produktov WooCommerce ako CSV. Konfigurovateľné "
"polia, filtre prahu zásob, podpora variantov. Dostupné v sekcii Produkty > "
"Export skladu."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1487
msgid "Export stock"
msgstr "Exportovať sklad"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1493
msgid "Social Login"
msgstr "Prihlásenie cez sociálne siete"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1494
msgid ""
"Let customers register and login via Google or Facebook. Displays branded "
"buttons on My Account, checkout, and WordPress login forms. Auto-creates "
"WooCommerce customer accounts."
msgstr ""
"Umožnite zákazníkom registrovať sa a prihlasovať cez Google alebo Facebook. "
"Zobrazuje značkové tlačidlá na stránke Môj účet, pri pokladni a vo "
"formulároch prihlásenia do WordPressu. Automaticky vytvára zákaznícke účty "
"WooCommerce."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1500
msgid "Enable Google login"
msgstr "Povoliť prihlásenie cez Google"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1501
msgid "Google Client ID"
msgstr "ID klienta Google"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1501
msgid "From Google Cloud Console > APIs & Services > Credentials"
msgstr "Z Google Cloud Console > API a služby > Prihlasovacie údaje"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1502
msgid "Google Client Secret"
msgstr "Tajný kľúč klienta Google"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1502
msgid "OAuth 2.0 Client Secret from the same credential"
msgstr "Tajný kľúč klienta OAuth 2.0 z rovnakých prihlasovacích údajov"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1503
msgid "Enable Facebook login"
msgstr "Povoliť prihlásenie cez Facebook"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1504
msgid "Facebook App ID"
msgstr "ID aplikácie Facebook"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1504
msgid "From Meta for Developers > App Dashboard > Settings > Basic"
msgstr "Z Meta for Developers > Panel aplikácie > Nastavenia > Základné"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1505
msgid "Facebook App Secret"
msgstr "Tajný kľúč aplikácie Facebook"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1505
msgid "App Secret from the same page"
msgstr "App Secret z rovnakej stránky"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1506
msgid "Auto-register new users"
msgstr "Automaticky registrovať nových používateľov"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1506
msgid "Create WooCommerce accounts automatically on first social login"
msgstr ""
"Vytvárať účty WooCommerce automaticky pri prvom prihlásení cez sociálne siete"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1511
msgid "Product Authors"
msgstr "Autori produktov"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1512
msgid ""
"Custom taxonomy for product authors/creators. Adds author names on product "
"pages and archives with Schema.org Person markup. Ideal for bookstores and "
"publishers."
msgstr ""
"Vlastná taxonómia pre autorov/tvorcov produktov. Pridáva mená autorov na "
"stránky produktov a do archívov s označením Schema.org Person. Ideálne pre "
"kníhkupectvá a vydavateľov."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1521 src/Service/ExpertReviewService.php:56
#: src/Service/ExpertReviewService.php:189
msgid "Expert Reviews"
msgstr "Odborné recenzie"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1522
msgid ""
"Custom post type for editorial product reviews. Link expert reviews to "
"products with ratings (1-10), verdicts, and Schema.org markup for SEO."
msgstr ""
"Vlastný typ príspevku pre redakčné recenzie produktov. Prepojte odborné "
"recenzie s produktmi s hodnotením (1-10), verdiktmi a označením Schema.org "
"pre SEO."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1527
msgid "Manage reviews"
msgstr "Spravovať recenzie"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1533
msgid "Social Proof Notifications"
msgstr "Upozornenia sociálneho dôkazu"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1534
msgid ""
"Floating purchase notifications showing recent orders (\"Jan from Warszawa "
"just bought...\"). Proven to increase conversions by 10-15%. Privacy-aware, "
"AJAX-loaded, configurable position and timing."
msgstr ""
"Plávajúce upozornenia o nákupoch zobrazujúce nedávne objednávky („Ján z "
"Varšavy práve kúpil...“). Preukázateľne zvyšujú konverzie o 10-15%. "
"Rešpektujú súkromie, načítavajú sa cez AJAX, konfigurovateľná pozícia a "
"načasovanie."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1540
msgid "Interval between popups (seconds)"
msgstr "Interval medzi vyskakovacími oknami (sekundy)"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1540
msgid "Time between showing consecutive notifications. Recommended: 6-12"
msgstr ""
"Čas medzi zobrazením po sebe nasledujúcich upozornení. Odporúčané: 6-12"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1541
msgid "Display duration (seconds)"
msgstr "Trvanie zobrazenia (sekundy)"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1541
msgid "How long each notification stays visible. Recommended: 4-6"
msgstr "Ako dlho zostáva každé upozornenie viditeľné. Odporúčané: 4-6"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1543
msgid "Anonymize customer names"
msgstr "Anonymizovať mená zákazníkov"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1543
msgid "Shows \"J. from Warszawa\" instead of full names. Recommended for GDPR"
msgstr "Zobrazuje „J. z Varšavy“ namiesto celých mien. Odporúčané pre GDPR"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1544
msgid "Hide on mobile devices"
msgstr "Skryť na mobilných zariadeniach"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1544
msgid "Disable on small screens to avoid obstructing content"
msgstr "Vypnúť na malých obrazovkách, aby sa neprekrýval obsah"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1549
msgid "Product Q&A"
msgstr "Otázky a odpovede o produkte"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1550
msgid ""
"Amazon-style questions and answers on product pages. Customers ask, anyone "
"answers. Admin email notifications, answer voting, Schema.org QAPage markup "
"for SEO."
msgstr ""
"Otázky a odpovede na stránkach produktov v štýle Amazonu. Zákazníci sa "
"pýtajú, ktokoľvek môže odpovedať. E-mailové upozornenia pre administrátora, "
"hlasovanie o odpovediach, značky Schema.org QAPage pre SEO."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1559
msgid "Trust Badges"
msgstr "Odznaky dôvery"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1560
msgid ""
"Configurable trust signals on product, cart, and checkout pages: secure "
"payment, fast delivery, returns, quality guarantee. Pure CSS + inline SVG "
"for zero performance impact."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurovateľné signály dôvery na stránkach produktu, košíka a pokladne: "
"bezpečná platba, rýchle doručenie, vrátenie tovaru, záruka kvality. Čisté "
"CSS + inline SVG bez vplyvu na výkon."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1567
msgid "Show on cart"
msgstr "Zobraziť v košíku"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1568
msgid "Show on checkout"
msgstr "Zobraziť pri pokladni"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1573
msgid "Live Cart Sidebar"
msgstr "Bočný panel živého košíka"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1574
msgid ""
"Slide-in cart drawer that opens when a product is added to cart. Shows cart "
"items, subtotal, free shipping progress bar, and quick checkout link. No "
"page reload needed."
msgstr ""
"Vysúvací panel košíka, ktorý sa otvorí po pridaní produktu do košíka. "
"Zobrazuje položky košíka, medzisúčet, ukazovateľ pokroku k doprave zdarma a "
"odkaz na rýchlu pokladňu. Bez potreby znovunačítania stránky."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1580
msgid "Auto-open on add to cart"
msgstr "Automaticky otvoriť po pridaní do košíka"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1581
msgid "Show subtotal"
msgstr "Zobraziť medzisúčet"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1582
msgid "Show free shipping progress"
msgstr "Zobraziť pokrok dopravy zdarma"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1583
msgid "Free shipping threshold"
msgstr "Hranica dopravy zdarma"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1583
msgid "Set to 0 to disable progress bar"
msgstr "Nastavte na 0 pre vypnutie ukazovateľa pokroku"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1584
msgid "Panel position"
msgstr "Pozícia panela"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1584
msgid "Right"
msgstr "Vpravo"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1584
msgid "Left"
msgstr "Vľavo"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1585
msgid "Show background overlay"
msgstr "Zobraziť stmavenie pozadia"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1590
msgid "Price History Chart"
msgstr "Graf histórie cien"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1591
msgid ""
"Visual SVG sparkline showing price trends over 30/90/180 days on product "
"pages. Uses Omnibus price data. Shows lowest/highest prices. Increases trust "
"and Omnibus transparency."
msgstr ""
"Vizuálna SVG mikrokrivka zobrazujúca trendy cien za 30/90/180 dní na "
"stránkach produktov. Používa cenové údaje Omnibus. Zobrazuje najnižšie/"
"najvyššie ceny. Zvyšuje dôveru a transparentnosť Omnibus."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1597
msgid "History period (days)"
msgstr "Obdobie histórie (dni)"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1597
msgid "Show price data from the last N days. Options: 30, 90, or 180"
msgstr "Zobraziť cenové údaje za posledných N dní. Možnosti: 30, 90 alebo 180"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1598
msgid "Show min/max prices"
msgstr "Zobraziť min./max. ceny"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1599
msgid "Line color"
msgstr "Farba čiary"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1599
msgid "CSS hex color for the chart line, e.g. #0369a1"
msgstr "Šestnástková farba CSS pre čiaru grafu, napr. #0369a1"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1604 src/Service/OrderExportService.php:38
#: src/Service/OrderExportService.php:39 src/Service/OrderExportService.php:92
msgid "Order Export"
msgstr "Export objednávok"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1605
msgid ""
"Export WooCommerce orders to CSV with configurable fields, date range and "
"status filters. 30+ exportable fields including products, customer data, and "
"coupons."
msgstr ""
"Exportujte objednávky WooCommerce do CSV s konfigurovateľnými poľami, "
"rozsahom dátumov a filtrami stavu. Viac ako 30 exportovateľných polí vrátane "
"produktov, údajov zákazníkov a kupónov."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1610
msgid "Export orders"
msgstr "Exportovať objednávky"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1616 src/Service/FaqService.php:40
#: src/Service/FaqService.php:41 src/Service/FaqService.php:46
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "Časté otázky"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1617
msgid ""
"FAQ custom post type with categories and accordion shortcode [polski_faq]. "
"Includes Schema.org FAQPage structured data for SEO rich snippets."
msgstr ""
"Vlastný typ príspevku FAQ s kategóriami a shortcode akordeónu [polski_faq]. "
"Zahŕňa štruktúrované údaje Schema.org FAQPage pre SEO rich snippets."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1622
msgid "Manage FAQ"
msgstr "Spravovať FAQ"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1628
#: src/Service/CustomCheckoutFieldsService.php:701
msgid "Custom Checkout Fields"
msgstr "Vlastné polia pokladne"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1629
msgid ""
"Add, modify and reorder checkout fields. Supports text, textarea, select, "
"checkbox, radio, number, email, date and phone types. Fields appear in "
"admin, emails and My Account."
msgstr ""
"Pridávajte, upravujte a meňte poradie polí pokladne. Podporuje typy text, "
"textarea, výber, zaškrtávacie pole, prepínač, číslo, e-mail, dátum a "
"telefón. Polia sa zobrazujú v administrácii, e-mailoch a na stránke Môj účet."

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1634
msgid "Manage fields"
msgstr "Spravovať polia"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1644 src/Admin/PageCompliancePage.php:45
#: src/Admin/PageCompliancePage.php:46 src/Admin/PageCompliancePage.php:56
msgid "Compliance checklist"
msgstr "Kontrolný zoznam súladu"

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1645
msgid ""
"Adds a Compliance checklist screen under Polski that reads your Privacy "
"Policy and Terms pages and reports which legally expected elements it can "
"find, plus a look at the cookie banner and accessibility. It is a keyword "
"heuristic, not legal advice, and it changes nothing on the storefront."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1654
msgid "Business identification block"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1655
msgid ""
"Publishes the seller details from the setup wizard (name, address, NIP, "
"REGON, e-mail, phone) as the [polski_business_info] shortcode and a "
"Gutenberg block, for the footer identification Polish consumer law expects. "
"Off by default: it prints your company data wherever you place it."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1664
msgid "Complaint form template"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1665
msgid ""
"A printable complaint form (formularz reklamacyjny) following the usual "
"UOKiK layout, with the seller section filled from the setup wizard. "
"Available as the [polski_complaint_template] shortcode, as an admin preview "
"with an HTML download, and over REST. A generic template, not legal advice. "
"Off by default."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1674
msgid "Copyright and image credits"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1675
msgid ""
"Adds the [polski_copyright] and [polski_image_credit] shortcodes and a "
"Copyright notice block. The year defaults to the current one and the owner "
"to your company name from the setup wizard. Off by default."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1684
msgid "SBOM (software bill of materials)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1685
msgid ""
"Adds an SBOM screen, reachable from Reports and tools, that generates a "
"CycloneDX 1.4 JSON list of the PHP (composer) and JS (npm) dependencies for "
"a security audit or a Cyber Resilience Act file. Admin only, nothing is sent "
"anywhere. Off by default."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1694
msgid "RODO training documents"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/ModulesPage.php:1695
msgid ""
"Adds a GDPR training screen, reachable from Reports and tools, with three "
"printable documents pre-filled with your shop data: a training logbook, a "
"summary of the RODO principles, and a data breach playbook with the 24 hour "
"internal and 72 hour UODO deadlines. Starter templates, not legal advice. "
"Off by default."
msgstr ""

