msgid "Go to the withdrawal form"
msgstr "Prejsť na formulár odstúpenia"

#. translators: 1: merchant name, 2: number of days
#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:87
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Bought from %1$s as a consumer? You have the right to withdraw from a "
"distance contract without giving a reason within %2$d days of receiving your "
"order. You do not need to log in to file the declaration: just enter below "
"the email address used for the purchase and the order number."
msgstr ""
"Ste spotrebiteľ a nakúpili ste u predajcu %1$s? Máte právo odstúpiť od "
"zmluvy uzavretej na diaľku bez uvedenia dôvodu v lehote %2$d dní odo dňa, "
"keď ste prevzali objednávku. Na podanie vyhlásenia sa nemusíte prihlasovať - "
"stačí, ak nižšie uvediete e-mailovú adresu použitú pri nákupe a číslo "
"objednávky."

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:102
msgid "How does it work? (expand)"
msgstr "Ako to funguje? (rozbaliť)"

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:106
msgid ""
"Once we have checked the details we will email a single-use link that opens "
"the withdrawal form. The link is valid for 30 minutes and works only once."
msgstr ""
"Po overení odošleme na zadanú adresu jednorazový odkaz, ktorý otvorí "
"formulár odstúpenia. Odkaz bude platný 30 minút a možno ho použiť iba raz."

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:109
msgid ""
"In the next step you choose whether to return the whole order or only some "
"items; you can also withdraw from individual units."
msgstr ""
"V ďalšom kroku vyberiete, či chcete vrátiť celú objednávku, alebo iba "
"vybrané položky (možné sú aj čiastočné odstúpenia od jednotlivých kusov)."

#. translators: %s = directive reference
#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:115
#, php-format
msgid ""
"After you submit the declaration you will get an email with the declaration "
"number, the date it was filed and a summary of the order. The right comes "
"from Article 27 of the Polish Consumer Rights Act, which implements "
"Directive %s."
msgstr ""
"Po odoslaní vyhlásenia dostanete e-mail s číslom vyhlásenia, dátumom podania "
"a súhrnom objednávky. Oprávnenie vyplýva z čl. 27 zákona o právach "
"spotrebiteľa implementujúceho smernicu %s."

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:116
msgid "2011/83/EU (as amended by 2023/2673)"
msgstr ""

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:153
msgid ""
"The number is in your purchase confirmation email, on the \"Your order #..."
"\" line."
msgstr ""
"Číslo nájdete v e-maile potvrdzujúcom nákup, v položke „Vaša objednávka #…”."

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:175
msgid ""
"We will email a secure link to this address that opens the withdrawal form."
msgstr "Na túto adresu odošleme bezpečný odkaz otvárajúci formulár odstúpenia."

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:180
msgid "All fields are required."
msgstr "Všetky polia sú povinné."

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:196
msgid ""
"The link is valid for 30 minutes and works only once. If the message does "
"not arrive, check your spam folder and enter the address again."
msgstr ""
"Odkaz bude platný 30 minút a možno ho použiť iba raz. Ak nedostanete správu, "
"skontrolujte priečinok Spam a zadajte adresu znova."

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:203
#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:258
msgid "How long do I have to withdraw from the contract?"
msgstr "V akej lehote môžem odstúpiť od zmluvy?"

#. translators: %d = days
#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:203
#, php-format
msgid ""
"By default you have %d days from the day you received the order. The period "
"runs from the day the goods came into your possession, or into the "
"possession of a third party other than the carrier."
msgstr ""
"Štandardne máte %d dní odo dňa prevzatia objednávky. Lehota plynie odo dňa, "
"keď ste tovar prevzali vy alebo tretia osoba iná ako prepravca."

#. translators: %d = days
#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:204
msgid "Can I return only some of the products?"
msgstr "Môžem vrátiť iba niektoré produkty?"

#. translators: %d = days
#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:204
msgid ""
"Yes. Once the form is open you choose which items the withdrawal covers. You "
"can withdraw from any number of units and the rest stay in the order."
msgstr ""
"Áno. Po otvorení formulára vyberiete, ktorých položiek sa má odstúpenie "
"týkať. Možno odstúpiť od vybraného počtu kusov - ostatné zostanú v "
"objednávke."

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:205
#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:266
msgid "What happens after I send the form?"
msgstr "Čo sa stane po odoslaní formulára?"

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:205
msgid ""
"You will get a confirmation email with a unique declaration number and a "
"full summary of the order. Then send the goods back to the shop's address "
"within 14 days of filing the declaration."
msgstr ""
"Dostanete potvrdzovací e-mail s jedinečným číslom vyhlásenia a úplným "
"súhrnom objednávky. Následne odošlite produkty na adresu obchodu v lehote 14 "
"dní od podania vyhlásenia."

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:206
#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:270
msgid "Are there products that cannot be returned?"
msgstr "Existujú produkty, ktoré nemožno vrátiť?"

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:206
msgid ""
"Yes. Under Article 38 of the Polish Consumer Rights Act the right of "
"withdrawal does not cover, among others, goods made to the consumer's "
"specification, goods that deteriorate rapidly, and goods sealed for hygiene "
"reasons once the seal is broken."
msgstr ""
"Áno. V súlade s čl. 38 zákona o právach spotrebiteľa sú z práva odstúpenia "
"vylúčené okrem iného produkty vyrobené na individuálnu objednávku, rýchlo sa "
"kaziace, a zapečatené z hygienických dôvodov po otvorení obalu."

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:210
msgid "Common questions"
msgstr "Najčastejšie otázky"

#. translators: %s = support email link
#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:232
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Having trouble with the form? Write to %s and we will help you file the "
"declaration by hand."
msgstr ""
"Máte problém s formulárom? Napíšte na %s - pomôžeme vám podať vyhlásenie "
"ručne."

#. translators: %s: merchant / shop name
#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:248
#, php-format
msgid "Who can withdraw from a contract at %s?"
msgstr "Kto môže odstúpiť od zmluvy v obchode %s?"

#. translators: %d: withdrawal period in days (typically 14)
#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:250
#, php-format
msgid ""
"By default you have %d days from the day you received the order to file the "
"declaration. The period runs from the day the goods came into your "
"possession, or into the possession of a third party indicated by you other "
"than the carrier."
msgstr ""
"Štandardne máte %d dní odo dňa prevzatia objednávky na podanie vyhlásenia. "
"Lehota plynie odo dňa, keď ste tovar prevzali vy alebo vami určená tretia "
"osoba iná ako prepravca."

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:255
msgid ""
"Any consumer, meaning a natural person buying for purposes outside their "
"trade or business. When you buy as a company, the right to withdraw without "
"giving a reason applies only in a limited form."
msgstr ""
"Každý spotrebiteľ, teda fyzická osoba nakupujúca na účely nesúvisiace s "
"podnikateľskou činnosťou. V prípade nákupu ako firma prislúcha právo na "
"odstúpenie bez uvedenia dôvodu iba v obmedzenom rozsahu."

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:262
msgid "Can I return only some of the products in the order?"
msgstr "Môžem vrátiť iba niektoré produkty z objednávky?"

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:263
msgid ""
"Yes. Once the form is open you choose which items the withdrawal covers: "
"every product, a single product, or just some of the units. The rest stay in "
"the order."
msgstr ""
"Áno. Po otvorení formulára vyberiete, ktorých položiek sa má odstúpenie "
"týkať - môžete vrátiť všetky produkty, jeden produkt alebo iba vybraný počet "
"kusov. Ostatné položky zostanú v objednávke."

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:267
msgid ""
"You will get an email confirming that the declaration was accepted, with a "
"unique declaration number and a full summary of the order. Then send the "
"goods back to the shop's address within 14 days of filing the declaration."
msgstr ""
"Dostanete e-mail potvrdzujúci prijatie vyhlásenia, obsahujúci jedinečné "
"číslo vyhlásenia a úplný súhrn objednávky. Následne odošlite produkty na "
"adresu obchodu v lehote 14 dní od podania vyhlásenia."

#: templates/forms/withdrawal-lookup.php:271
msgid ""
"Yes. Under Article 38 of the Polish Consumer Rights Act the right of "
"withdrawal does not cover, among others, goods made to the consumer's "
"specification, goods that deteriorate rapidly, goods sealed for hygiene "
"reasons once the seal is broken, and digital content supplied with the "
"consumer's express consent before the withdrawal period ended."
msgstr ""
"Áno. V súlade s čl. 38 zákona o právach spotrebiteľa sú z práva odstúpenia "
"vylúčené okrem iného produkty vyrobené na individuálnu objednávku, rýchlo sa "
"kaziace, zapečatené z hygienických dôvodov po otvorení obalu, a digitálny "
"obsah dodaný s výslovným súhlasom spotrebiteľa pred uplynutím lehoty."

